flowchart TD
  Login[Login identifier + password] --> Normalize[Strict type candidates]
  Normalize --> Alias{Exactly one verified alias?}
  Alias -->|No or ambiguous| Generic[Generic sign-in failure]
  Alias -->|Yes| Account{Active user + password?}
  Account -->|No| Generic
  Account -->|Yes| Create[Random opaque secret]
  Create --> Registry[(AuthSession: hash, version, expiry, masked client)]
  Create --> Cookie[Signed HttpOnly Strict cookie]
  Cookie --> Request[Authenticated request]
  Request --> RegistryCheck{Hash + current + expiry + credential version}
  RegistryCheck -->|No| Deny[Deny / fresh login]
  RegistryCheck -->|Yes| Authorize[Existing role and object authorization]

  Add[Add work/personal email or mobile] --> Pending[Pending alias]
  Pending --> Code[HMAC code, expiry, attempts]
  Code --> Possession{Possession proved?}
  Possession -->|Yes| Verified[Verified login/recovery alias]
  Possession -->|No| Pending

  Forgot[Forgot Password: identifier + channel type] --> GenericRecovery[Always generic response]
  Forgot --> Eligible{Active account + verified selected channel + adapter?}
  Eligible -->|No| GenericRecovery
  Eligible -->|Yes| Reset[256-bit reset token; hash only]
  Reset --> Fragment[Private delivery: URL fragment]
  Fragment --> NewPassword[Strong new password + old-password rejection]
  NewPassword --> Credential[Increment credential version]
  Credential --> Revoke[Revoke every session and reset]

  LocalSink[LOCAL_TEST_SINK] --> CopiedOnly{Ignored copied DB?}
  CopiedOnly -->|No / operational / release| Refuse[Fail closed]
  CopiedOnly -->|Yes| Code
  LiveProvider[Live email/SMS] -. not authorised .-> Refuse

  Registry --> SafeBackup[Version 37 authSecurity evidence]
  Code --> SafeBackup
  Reset --> SafeBackup
  SafeBackup --> Exclude[Exclude code, reset, session and password hashes]
  SafeBackup --> RestoreSafe[Restore challenges/resets invalid; sessions revoked]

  Matrix[Independent copied-DB, HTTP and Browser QA] --> ReleaseGate{All gates pass?}
  RestoreSafe --> ReleaseGate
  ReleaseGate -->|Yes| Release[Fast-forward main; retained branch and release tag]
  ReleaseGate -->|No| Refuse
  Release -. no deployment or provider activation .-> Refuse
